abstract: >-
  Retrieval-based analysis of data protection and digital identity policy
  across Africa. The backend of the Policy Analyzer extracts information from
  policy documents, answers questions from them, and serves country reference
  data.
keywords:
  - data protection
  - digital identity
  - policy analysis
  - Africa
  - retrieval-augmented generation
